{"id":148881,"title":"Dynamic Scene Reconstruction: Recent Advance in Real-time Rendering and Streaming","url":"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2503.08166","final_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.08166","year":2025,"kind":"paper","source":"s2","doi":"10.48550/arxiv.2503.08166","arxiv":"2503.08166","sha256":"e9590742415b923a8dab499cafc3d1cbef63c7aad84a175f9882731830554ee5","ctype":"application/pdf","text_src":"arxiv","fetched_at":1793320272.4796991,"text_chars":121578,"abstract":"Representing and rendering dynamic scenes from 2D images is a fundamental yet challenging problem in computer vision and graphics. This survey provides a comprehensive review of the evolution and advancements in dynamic scene representation and rendering, with a particular emphasis on recent progress in Neural Radiance Fields based and 3D Gaussian Splatting based reconstruction methods. We systematically summarize existing approaches, categorize them according to their core principles, compile relevant datasets, compare the performance of various methods on these benchmarks, and explore the challenges and future research directions in this rapidly evolving field. In total, we review over 170 relevant papers, offering a broad perspective on the state of the art in this domain.","file":null,"marks":["unofficial"],"links":["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.08166","https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2503.08166"],"cited_by":[{"path":"2257-3d-gaussian-splatting-3dgs-preliminaries.md","name":"3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) Preliminaries","k":41},{"path":"7992-4d-gaussian-splatting.md","name":"4D Gaussian Splatting","k":12},{"path":"6866-deformable-3dgs.md","name":"Deformable 3DGS","k":3},{"path":"12804-dual-domain-deformation-model.md","name":"Dual-Domain Deformation Model","k":2},{"path":"13782-darenerf.md","name":"DaReNeRF","k":2},{"path":"6146-4d-rotor-gaussian-splatting.md","name":"4D-Rotor Gaussian Splatting","k":4},{"path":"13906-hypernerf.md","name":"HyperNeRF","k":5},{"path":"15546-dynamic-scene-and-temporal-modeling.md","name":"Dynamic Scene and Temporal Modeling","k":2},{"path":"17065-gps-gaussian-network-architecture.md","name":"GPS-Gaussian Network Architecture","k":2},{"path":"9203-3dgstream.md","name":"3DGStream","k":3},{"path":"17949-sync-nerf-offset-optimization.md","name":"Sync-NeRF Offset Optimization","k":2},{"path":"18219-dynamic-and-articulated-scene-modeling.md","name":"Dynamic and Articulated Scene Modeling","k":7},{"path":"17282-gsedit.md","name":"GSEdit","k":3},{"path":"17295-gaumesh.md","name":"GauMesh","k":2},{"path":"21905-neural-scene-flow-fields-nsff.md","name":"Neural Scene Flow Fields (NSFF)","k":3},{"path":"18544-non-rigid-nerf-nr-nerf.md","name":"Non-rigid NeRF (NR-NeRF)","k":2},{"path":"22377-dynamicnerf.md","name":"DynamicNeRF","k":1},{"path":"7335-real-time-4dgs.md","name":"Real-time 4DGS","k":2},{"path":"8677-de-nerf.md","name":"DE-NeRF","k":1},{"path":"20894-dynamic-3d-gaussian-tracking.md","name":"Dynamic 3D Gaussian Tracking","k":2},{"path":"13794-nerf-ds.md","name":"NeRF-DS","k":3},{"path":"18592-nerflow.md","name":"NeRFlow","k":2},{"path":"21867-dynamic-nerf.md","name":"Dynamic NeRF","k":2},{"path":"19012-headgas-change-all.md","name":"HeadGaS change all","k":2},{"path":"11809-gags.md","name":"GaGS","k":2},{"path":"23638-composition-with-4d-gaussians.md","name":"Composition with 4D Gaussians","k":2}]}